 team intraprendono quindi una spedizione nelle profondità del ghiacciaio."},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Legend","overview":"An archeologist noticed that the texture of the relics discovered during the excavation of a glacier closely resembled a jade pendant seen in one of his dreams. He and his team then embark on an expedition into the depths of the glacier."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"传说","overview":"考古专家陈教授（成龙 饰）察觉，学生在冰川考察时发现的文物上的纹理和自己梦中所见到的一块玉佩极为相似，仿佛通过玉佩将梦境和现实联通了起来。带着所有的疑问，陈教授率领考察队深入冰川神庙，探寻梦中真相，共同开启一场奇幻冒险之旅。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xoMw7nbw4cJlcKX945GuwQOdpsm.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xoMw7nbw4cJlcKX945GuwQOdpsm.png","language":"en","width":762,"height":280},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kbQu0pUpRW3KRA36PQ08SNXc1E5.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kbQu0pUpRW3KRA36PQ08SNXc1E5.png","language":"zh","width":504,"height":719}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xCem4v2nLhV53ti2mIvxKImM3xo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xCem4v2nLhV53ti2mIvxKImM3xo.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p7w1mmaUjZ2PL7rMj0DpKnENNrI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p7w1mmaUjZ2PL7rMj0DpKnENNrI.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xvK5585M16REiQY24aMrpjv4pHE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xvK5585M16REiQY24aMrpjv4pHE.jpg","language":"zh","width":770,"height":1084},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lEsgtru47SEKWHYnLZ1AuLhrVJx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lEsgtru47SEKWHYnLZ1AuLhrVJx.jpg","language":"zh","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2eLjgesRLYQ8kjfwusSwxgNFcHv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2eLjgesRLYQ8kjfw